# Config YAML Conventions

## Merge Order (lib/load_params.py:get_params)
`defaults.all_notebooks` → `all_notebooks` → `defaults.notebook_XX` → `notebook_XX`

## Required Top-Level Keys
- `run_name` — output dir: `outputs/{run_name}/`
- `plate_model.plate_model_name` — e.g. `zahirovic2022`
- `plate_model.use_provided_plate_model` — `true` for bundled Alfonso2024
- `timespan.min` / `timespan.max` — integer Ma
- `deposits_filename` — CSV in `data_source/deposits/`
- `regions_filename` — GeoJSON in `data_source/regions/`
- `reference_feature: trenches`
- `study_zone_buffer: 6.0` — degrees
- `n_jobs`, `random_seed`, `overwrite_output`

## Feature Sets
```yaml
feature_sets:
  subduction: {enabled: true}   # trench distance, convergence
  crustal:    {enabled: false}  # crustal thickness rasters
  mantle:     {enabled: true, data_dir: zahirovic2022}
  erodep:     {enabled: false}  # erosion/deposition
```

## Per-Notebook Override Pattern
- Null (`~`) means inherit from `all_notebooks`
- `notebook_00c.grid_resolution` — degrees (default `0.5`)
- `notebook_04.outlier_contamination` — float (default `0.06`)
- `notebook_01.create_svm` / `create_regional_models` — bool
